68	    // (120 + 230 = 350 still owed). A DRAFT (170) has not been sent yet, and a PAID invoice (400) is
69	    // already settled, so neither is money I am owed. The total ever invoiced is 920 — the dashboard
70	    // must show the 350 that is OWED, not the 920 invoiced, not the 400 already paid, and not the
